# Skills

This directory contains the set of skills I want to include across all code sessions. Most skills are sourced from other authors; attribution can be traced via the skills-lock.json file.

Some skills have been slightly modified to behave my liking.

## Workflow

Update the skills with 

```sh
pnpm skills:sync
```

Review the changes, then commit and push the desired final state.

## Installing

```sh
pnpx skills@latest add nickgros/agent-plugins
```
